<p id="poem">
    <i style="font-size: 0.3em;">HINT: I hide in plain sight...</i><br>
    <span style="color: red">Y</span>onder lies the fading gleam, <br>
    <span style="color: red">O</span>ver hills of dreams unseen, <br>
    <span style="color: red">U</span>nderneath the starlit beam, <br>
    <span style="color: red">R</span>iddles dance in twilight's seam, <br>
    <span style="color: red">E</span>choes whisper through the trees, <br>
    
    <br>
    <span style="color: red">N</span>ever seeking, always keen, <br>
    <span style="color: red">O</span>racles of forgotten seas. <br>
    <span style="color: red">T</span>hrough the mist where shadows dart, <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color: red">S</span>omewhere lost, the truth departs, <br> 
    <span style="color: red">M</span>ysteries in twilight's art, <br>
    <span style="color: red">A</span>cross the veils of darkened charts. <br>
    <span style="color: red">R</span>ealms of wonder, minds unbent, <br> 
    <span style="color: red">T</span>rails of knowledge poorly spent.</p>